    "title": "Buchanan County Sheriff's Office announces promotions - NewsBreak",
    "text": "10 hours ago The Buchanan County Sheriff's Office and Sheriff Bill Puett announced the following promotions for officers Tuesday:. Sgt. Tami Parsons will be promoted to Lieutenant May 1st to run the Criminal Investigations Division and will be the Cybercrime Taskforce Commander, as well as, Assistant Officer-in-Charge of the Investigations Division encompassing all investigation functions in the Sheriff's Office. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
